\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-84a883f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"84a883f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Community Management<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2832c24 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2832c24\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We can manage your community that align perfectly with your company\u2019s persona and identity, ensuring that interactions and content reflect your brand\u2019s values and style.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1b82c57 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1b82c57\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e9cc88f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e9cc88f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Skinsociate Panel<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4412916 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4412916\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Skinsociate community as a part of Skinproof have a chance to be a consumer panel refers to an individual who participates in skincare based on their problem and type of skin, gender, domicile and age that can gain insight and information.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\